def binary_search(arr, x): 
    start = 0
    end = len(arr) - 1

    while start <= end: 

        mid = (start + end)//2; 

        if arr[mid] == x: 
            return mid 

        elif arr[mid] < x: 
            start = mid + 1

        else: 
            end = mid - 1
    return -1

Time Complexity: O(log n)

